{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789808245000-6032d6", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "帮我出一份生产周报模板，老板看得快的那种。", "id": "5863a21cec46409080927996db59861b", "created_at": "2026-09-19T08:57:25", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "639531cb72da4ceb8390e3b985d8b1c4", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T08:57:25", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "41aada85880045b1936769a7ef35cb45", "created_at": "2026-09-19T08:57:33", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T08:58:05"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**生产周报（一页版）**\n① 本周产量/计划（达成率%）\n② 质量一次合格率 / 客诉件数\n③ 交付：按期 X 单 / 延迟 X 单（原因归类）\n④ 设备：故障停机时长 Top3\n⑤ 下周风险与需要的支持（≤3 条）\n数据不超过一页，趋势用红黄绿标。", "id": "3706578de0b2485dbd649a90882535b3", "created_at": "2026-09-19T08:57:33", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T08:58:05"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "0bf68db3821d41fd84e147ca91eb42fc", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T08:57:33", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T08:58:05", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "达成率的分母是计划工时还是订单数？", "id": "14438407954f4429bb7954a946d9be35", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:03:25", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "817714bd7f4f457a95060b3dc013de0b", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:03:25", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "7ba29773c7b148078aa7e63cd193d863", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:03:33", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:04:05"}, {"type": "text", "text": "建议用**计划产量（台/套）**做分母，比工时直观也不受工时口径影响；工时达成率作为第二行辅助指标给生产内部用。", "id": "07b66164a12649599667e549afcd3a79", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:03:33", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:04:05"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "e6481d9e9c3e4fd3a67bb576e09083a7", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:03:33", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:04:05", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "周报数据谁提供？", "id": "08eb1dc994d9496dbf498bc7d10adfd5", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:05:05", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "fb8c09024e524745a1e87d1e3c4497e7", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:05:05", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "79ed64e2b0d74375abb5b8c3b9fba96e", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:05:11", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:05:50"}, {"type": "text", "text": "产量与合格率从 MES/质检日报取，交付从 ERP 取，设备停机从维修记录取。周报是你拼数据的，不是各部门各写一段的——口径统一后 15 分钟能出。", "id": "5666dd55f362464bb840ee03a16fd136", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:05:11", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:05:50"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "5eb5e6c0efdb45028d4326d4b2741755", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:05:11", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:05:50", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "延迟订单的原因归类怎么分？", "id": "0e3f768a14ca43d0b442bbad1e0ecd43", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:07:50", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "a677e00f5cb04b57a9b736ae0383b3e4", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:07:50", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "51d7c9abb3af45aaa6380e503b3f195d", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:07:56", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:08:28"}, {"type": "text", "text": "固定四类：①缺料 ②设备故障 ③插单挤占 ④客户原因（图纸/场地未就绪）。每次延迟必须归入一类并填单号，月底统计才知道该抓采购还是抓设备。", "id": "0b0b6bd92bc347d48fa92599400fb299", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:07:56", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:08:28"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "0f44533ff1004cdeb53998ace0ece0c1", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:07:56", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:08:28", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "延迟订单的原因归类怎么分？", "id": "4344cd660c8b466ea80319c82f1fa178", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:10:28", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "9b77551a90db41f999ed1e2d5a3a3cee", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:10:28", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "fbcd01b3ca7b4bbab7f1b743cf77699f", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:10:34", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:11:04"}, {"type": "text", "text": "固定四类：①缺料 ②设备故障 ③插单挤占 ④客户原因。每次延迟必须归入一类并填单号，月底统计才知道该抓采购还是抓设备。", "id": "ee44ad606d7c4b9e802f4c1a0d5be3e0", "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:10:34", "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:11:04"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "415f8882242d412a83b791e04a855d1e", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-19T09:10:34", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-19T09:11:04", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}